abstract: >-
  PropCare Cloud is a multi-role property maintenance platform built with
  React, ASP.NET Core, PostgreSQL, and AWS. It supports tenant onboarding,
  property and maintenance workflows, private serverless attachments,
  asynchronous notifications, and cloud observability.
keywords:
